\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 \strokec2 Driving Claude Code\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\fs28 \cf0 The first session\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Open in the repo. Give it this, not a description of the app:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Read CLAUDE.md and docs/ARCHITECTURE.md first.\
This scaffold has never run against a live database. Get stage 1 working: 
\f2\fs26 make db
\f1\fs24 , load a small USDA subset, bootstrap a user, run the bot, send it "black coffee", get a confirmation card, press confirm, see it in /today.\
Fix what breaks. Do not add features, do not restructure, do not rewrite modules that already exist. If something looks wrong but is covered by an invariant in CLAUDE.md, leave it and tell me.\
Then let it work. Expect real breakage in four places, all of them ordinary:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 asyncpg returns 
\f3\fs26 Decimal
\f0\fs24  for 
\f3\fs26 numeric
\f0\fs24  columns.
\f1\b0  Arithmetic against floats raises. Either cast at the query boundary or set a type codec.\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0
\f3\b\fs26 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 day_progress()
\f0\fs24  and 
\f3\fs26 target_on()
\f0\fs24  are 
\f3\fs26 RETURNS TABLE
\f0\fs24  functions.
\f1\b0  If the column list drifts from what 
\f2\fs26 db.py
\f1\fs24  expects, Postgres errors unhelpfully.\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	3	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 aiogram 3 handler order.
\f1\b0  
\f2\fs26 F.text & ~F.text.startswith("/")
\f1\fs24  must not shadow command handlers. Registration order matters.\
\ls2\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	4	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Markdown parse failures
\f1\b0  on food names containing 
\f2\fs26 _
\f1\fs24  or 
\f2\fs26 *
\f1\fs24 . There is an 
\f2\fs26 _esc()
\f1\fs24  helper in 
\f2\fs26 render.py
\f1\fs24 ; it is not applied everywhere it should be.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Those four are the price of a scaffold that compiles but has not run. None are design problems.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 The instruction that matters most\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\fs24 \cf0 "Do not add features."
\f1\b0  Repeat it every session until the eval set exists. An agent handed a codebase with obvious gaps will fill them, and the gaps here are deliberate \'97 the dashboard, barcode scanning, Apple Health sync, pgvector \'97 all listed in 
\f2\fs26 ARCHITECTURE.md
\f1\fs24  \'a710 as intentionally absent. Building them before you know whether the parse layer is accurate is building on an unmeasured foundation.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

