\ls3\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	3	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Nothing for two weeks.
\f1\b0  Collect. Do not open Claude Code.\
\ls3\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	4	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Stage 4
\f1\b0  \'97 the eval harness: a script that replays the 40-meal set through both models and prints MAPE on mass, MAPE on energy, component F1, escalation precision, and a calibration table. This is the one place worth letting it write something substantial and new.\
\ls3\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	5	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
